{"sourceLanguage":"en","version":"1.0","strings":{"GitHub token for Copilot (fine-grained, only “Copilot Requests”)":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Žeton GitHub za Copilot (fine-grained, le »Copilot Requests«)"}}}},"GitHub token for Copilot (saved; enter to replace)":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Žeton GitHub za Copilot (shranjen; vnesi za zamenjavo)"}}}},"GitHub Copilot CLI as an agent model in the session's folder.":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"GitHub Copilot CLI kot agentni model v mapi seje."}}}},"Models (comma-separated; empty = only the default, “auto”)":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Modeli (ločeni z vejico; prazno = le privzeti, »auto«)"}}}},"Allow web access (fetch tool)":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dovoli dostop do spleta (orodje fetch)"}}}},"Allow commands (in a sandbox)":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dovoli ukaze (v sandboxu)"}}}},"The claude-copilot models run Copilot CLI as an agent in the session's folder, also in folders shared from other Macs, always in a sandbox with a fresh Copilot home for each request. By default it may only read the session's folder; with writing on it may edit files there. It signs in only with the token below, a fine-grained token with only the “Copilot Requests” permission, never with the GitHub CLI's sign-in, which other agents could read.":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Modeli claude-copilot zaženejo Copilot CLI kot agenta v mapi seje, tudi v mapah, deljenih z drugih Macov, vedno v sandboxu s svežo domačo mapo Copilot za vsako zahtevo. Privzeto sme mapo seje le brati; s pisanjem sme v njej urejati datoteke. Prijavi se le z žetonom spodaj, fine-grained žetonom le z dovoljenjem »Copilot Requests«, nikoli s prijavo GitHub CLI, ki bi jo lahko prebrali drugi agenti."}}}},"Allow Copilot to run commands?":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dovoliš Copilotu, da izvaja ukaze?"}}}},"Copilot then runs commands as you on this Mac, in a sandbox that writes only to the session's folder and a temporary folder, and hides your keys, sign-ins and app data; commands can still read your other files and use the network. Commands can use the Copilot token to make Copilot requests on your account. Allow only if you trust the devices that use Copilot.":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Copilot nato izvaja ukaze kot ti na tem Macu, v sandboxu, ki piše le v mapo seje in začasno mapo ter skrije tvoje ključe, prijave in podatke aplikacij; ukazi lahko še vedno berejo tvoje druge datoteke in uporabljajo omrežje. Ukazi lahko z žetonom Copilot pošiljajo zahteve Copilot na tvoj račun. Dovoli le, če zaupaš napravam, ki uporabljajo Copilot."}}}},"Allow Commands":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dovoli ukaze"}}}},"Cancel":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Prekliči"}}}},"Copilot CLI":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Copilot CLI"}}}},"The claude-grok models run “grok -p” as an agent in the session's folder, also in folders shared from other Macs. Grok's kernel sandbox (workspace) lets it write only to that folder. Devices that use Grok can read every file this user can read, and they share this Mac's Grok sessions (~/.grok). Without writing it runs read-only. Sign in once with “grok login”.":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Modeli claude-grok zaženejo »grok -p« kot agenta v mapi seje, tudi v mapah, deljenih z drugih Macov. Grokov sandbox v jedru (workspace) mu dovoli pisanje le v to mapo. Naprave, ki uporabljajo Grok, lahko berejo vsako datoteko, ki jo lahko bere ta uporabnik, in si delijo seje Grok tega Maca (~/.grok). Brez pisanja teče samo za branje. Enkrat se prijavi z »grok login«."}}}},"Grok CLI":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Grok CLI"}}}},"Working…":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dela …"}}}},"Allow writing in the session's folder":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dovoli pisanje v mapo seje"}}}},"Allow network access for commands":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dovoli omrežje za ukaze"}}}},"Sandbox":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Sandbox"}}}},"The claude-codex models (one per Codex model of your account) run “codex exec” as an agent in the session's folder, also in folders shared from other Macs. Its sandbox writes only to that folder and the allowed folders from Claude CLI. Devices that use Codex can read every file this user can read, and they share this Mac's Codex sessions (~/.codex). Sign in once with “codex login”.":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Modeli claude-codex (po en za vsak model Codex tvojega računa) zaženejo »codex exec« kot agenta v mapi seje, tudi v mapah, deljenih z drugih Macov. Njegov sandbox piše le v to mapo in dovoljene mape iz Claude CLI. Naprave, ki uporabljajo Codex, lahko berejo vsako datoteko, ki jo lahko bere ta uporabnik, in si delijo seje Codex tega Maca (~/.codex). Enkrat se prijavi z »codex login«."}}}},"Codex CLI":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Codex CLI"}}}},"Siri answers with the personal context of this Mac's user (notes, documents, messages that Apple Intelligence can use). Other Macs get it only when you allow them below. Siri cannot read your project files.":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Siri odgovarja z osebnim kontekstom uporabnika tega Maca (zapiski, dokumenti, sporočila, ki jih lahko uporabi Apple Intelligence). Drugi Maci jo dobijo le, če jih spodaj dovoliš. Datotek projekta Siri ne more brati."}}}},"Macs that connected with minigw (0.4.4 or newer). The switch allows Siri AI for that Mac. This Mac always has it. A removed device appears again when it connects, with Siri off.":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Maci, ki so se povezali z minigw (0.4.4 ali novejšim). Stikalo dovoli Siri AI za ta Mac. Ta Mac jo ima vedno. Odstranjena naprava se ob naslednji povezavi znova pojavi, s Siri izklopljeno."}}}},"Codex":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Codex"}}}},"Devices":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Naprave"}}}},"Last seen %@":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nazadnje %@"}}}},"Not seen since Mini Gateway started":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ni se povezala od zagona Mini Gateway"}}}},"Agents get every Claude Code tool on this Mac, but files only in the allowed folders: commands run in a sandbox that cannot read your home folder or write outside these folders.":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Agenti dobijo vsa orodja Claude Code na tem Macu, datoteke pa le v dovoljenih mapah: ukazi tečejo v sandboxu, ki ne more brati domače mape niti pisati zunaj teh map."}}}},"Remove":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Odstrani"}}}},"Agents work only in these folders. Folders shared from other Macs (minigw) are included automatically.":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Agenti delajo le v teh mapah. Mape, deljene z drugih Macov (minigw), so vključene samodejno."}}}},"Allowed folders":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dovoljene mape"}}}},"Add Folder…":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dodaj mapo …"}}}},"Add":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dodaj"}}}},"Allow local tools":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dovoli lokalna orodja"}}}},"Tools":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Orodja"}}}},"Open at Login":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Odpri ob prijavi"}}}},"Open Login Items":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Odpri elemente ob prijavi"}}}},"Waiting for approval in System Settings → General → Login Items.":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Čaka na odobritev v Sistemskih nastavitvah → Splošno → Elementi ob prijavi."}}}},"Could not change: %@":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Spremembe ni bilo mogoče shraniti: %@"}}}},"Quit & Reopen":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Končaj in znova odpri"}}}},"Download…":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Prenesi …"}}}},"Install":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Namesti"}}}},"Reinstall":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Namesti znova"}}}},"Installed: %@":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nameščeno: %@"}}}},"Installed: %@ – add %@ to your PATH":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nameščeno: %1$@ – dodajte %2$@ v PATH"}}}},"Not installed":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ni nameščeno"}}}},"Install failed: %@":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Namestitev ni uspela: %@"}}}},"Saved: %@":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Shranjeno: %@"}}}},"Save failed: %@":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Shranjevanje ni uspelo: %@"}}}},"Command-line tool":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ukaz v terminalu"}}}},"On the other Mac run: minigw connect %@ --token <token>":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Na drugem Macu zaženite: minigw connect %@ --token <žeton>"}}}},"Starts Claude Code through this gateway, e.g. “minigw --model claude-apple-fm”. Also: minigw connect | status | models | disconnect. Install links the signed command into your PATH and connects it; Download saves a copy for another Mac.":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Zažene Claude Code prek tega prehoda, npr. »minigw --model claude-apple-fm«. Še: minigw connect | status | models | disconnect. Namesti poveže podpisani ukaz v vaš PATH in ga poveže s prehodom; Prenesi shrani kopijo za drug Mac."}}}},"General":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Splošno"}}}},"Changes are applied automatically.":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Spremembe se uveljavijo samodejno."}}}},"Token":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Žeton"}}}},"Models":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Modeli"}}}},"Settings…":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nastavitve …"}}}},"Hide":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Skrij"}}}},"Timeout (s)":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Časovna meja (s)"}}}},"Invalid: %@":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Neveljavno: %@"}}}},"Base URL":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Osnovni URL"}}}},"Quit":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Končaj"}}}},"Setting sources":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Viri nastavitev"}}}},"Accessibility: allowed":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dostopnost: dovoljeno"}}}},"Disable All":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Onemogoči vse"}}}},"Enable the provider to load its models":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Omogočite ponudnika, da se naložijo modeli"}}}},"Error: %@":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Napaka: %@"}}}},"Enter an API key to enable":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Za vklop vnesite ključ API"}}}},"API key (default; enter to replace)":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ključ API (privzeti; vnesite novega za zamenjavo)"}}}},"API key (saved; enter to replace)":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ključ API (shranjen; vnesite novega za zamenjavo)"}}}},"Aliases (advanced)":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aliasi (napredno)"}}}},"HTTP %@ from %@":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"HTTP %1$@ z %2$@"}}}},"Status":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Stanje"}}}},"Server":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Strežnik"}}}},"API key":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ključ API"}}}},"Accessibility: not allowed":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dostopnost: ni dovoljeno"}}}},"Unexpected response from %@":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nepričakovan odgovor z %@"}}}},"Model":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Model"}}}},"Invalid base URL":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Neveljaven osnovni URL"}}}},"Clear":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Počisti"}}}},"Enable All":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Omogoči vse"}}}},"Path":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pot"}}}},"Detected: %@ · %@":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Najdeno: %1$@ · %2$@"}}}},"Context":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kontekst"}}}},"Showing %lld of %lld – refine the search to see more":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Prikazanih %1$lld od %2$lld – za več zožite iskanje"}}}},"claude not found in PATH":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"claude ni v PATH"}}}},"Select the Claude Code executable":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Izberite izvršljivo datoteko Claude Code"}}}},"Provider":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ponudnik"}}}},"Cannot connect (%@). Check that this Mac can reach the server (VPN, firewall). For a device on the same subnet, also allow Mini Gateway in System Settings → Privacy & Security → Local Network.":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Povezava ni mogoča (%@). Preverite, ali ta Mac doseže strežnik (VPN, požarni zid). Za napravo v istem podomrežju v Sistemskih nastavitvah → Zasebnost in varnost → Lokalno omrežje dovolite tudi Mini Gateway."}}}},"Show":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pokaži"}}}},"No API key":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ni ključa API"}}}},"%lld of %lld enabled":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"%1$lld od %2$lld omogočenih"}}}},"Allowed clients (IP; empty = all)":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dovoljeni odjemalci (IP; prazno = vsi)"}}}},"Copy Token":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Kopiraj žeton"}}}},"One per line “alias = upstream ID, context window” (e.g. qwen = qwen/qwen3-coder, 128k). When set, these define the models instead of the table.":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Po en na vrstico »alias = upstream ID, kontekstno okno« (npr. qwen = qwen/qwen3-coder, 128k). Če so vpisani, določajo modele namesto tabele."}}}},"Stopped":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ustavljen"}}}},"Instructions":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Navodila"}}}},"Port":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Vrata"}}}},"Activity":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dejavnost"}}}},"Loading models…":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nalagam modele …"}}}},"Choose…":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Izberi …"}}}},"Duration":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Trajanje"}}}},"Tools (comma-separated; empty = none)":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Orodja (ločena z vejico; prazno = brez)"}}}},"Unexpected response from /v1/models":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nepričakovan odgovor z /v1/models"}}}},"Search models":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Iskanje modelov"}}}},"Permission mode":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Način dovoljenj"}}}},"Cannot connect (%@)":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Povezava ni mogoča (%@)"}}}},"HTTP %@ – check the API key":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"HTTP %@ – preverite ključ API"}}}},"Open Accessibility Settings":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Odpri nastavitve dostopnosti"}}}},"Activity…":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dejavnost …"}}}},"No requests":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ni zahtev"}}}},"Time":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Čas"}}}},"Listening on %@:%@":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Posluša na %1$@:%2$@"}}}},"New Token":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nov žeton"}}}},"Enabled":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Omogočeno"}}}},"Executable (empty = auto-detect)":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Izvršljiva datoteka (prazno = samodejno)"}}}},"Address":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Naslov"}}}},"Choose":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Izberi"}}}},"Refresh":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Osveži"}}}},"Save and Restart":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Shrani in znova zaženi"}}}},"Allow unencrypted connections from other Macs":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dovoli nešifrirane povezave z drugih Macov"}}}},"minigw 0.4 and newer always encrypts. Turn on only for other clients on a trusted network.":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"minigw 0.4 in novejši vedno šifrira. Vklopite le za druge odjemalce v zaupanja vrednem omrežju."}}}},"Version %@ (%@)":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Različica %1$@ (%2$@)"}}}},"About":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"O aplikaciji"}}}},"Version":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Različica"}}}},"License":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Licenca"}}}},"Back":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nazaj"}}}},"Forward":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Naprej"}}}},"Settings":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nastavitve"}}}},"Address, port and access token of the gateway, and the app version.":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Naslov, vrata in žeton prehoda ter različica aplikacije."}}}},"Models of an Anthropic-compatible provider, passed through to Claude Code.":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Modeli ponudnika, združljivega z Anthropic API, posredovani v Claude Code."}}}},"The Siri AI app as a model, driven in the background.":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Aplikacija Siri AI kot model, upravljana v ozadju."}}}},"Apple's on-device model: private, without a network.":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Applov model na napravi: zaseben, brez omrežja."}}}},"Your local Claude Code as an agent model, with tools in the allowed folders.":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Tvoj lokalni Claude Code kot agent, z orodji v dovoljenih mapah."}}}},"OpenAI Codex CLI as an agent model in the session's folder.":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"OpenAI Codex CLI kot agent v mapi seje."}}}},"xAI Grok CLI as an agent model in the session's folder.":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"xAI Grok CLI kot agent v mapi seje."}}}},"Add Provider":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dodaj ponudnika"}}}},"Other Anthropic-compatible provider":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Drug ponudnik, združljiv z Anthropic API"}}}},"Remove %@?":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Odstranim %@?"}}}},"Its settings and API key are deleted from this Mac.":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Nastavitve in ključ API se izbrišejo s tega Maca."}}}},"Name":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ime"}}}},"The built-in providers cannot be removed; turn them off instead.":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Privzetih ponudnikov ni mogoče odstraniti; namesto tega jih izklopi."}}}},"This provider is on: Claude Code sessions that use its models stop working. Its settings and API key are deleted from this Mac.":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ta ponudnik je vklopljen: seje Claude Code, ki uporabljajo njegove modele, nehajo delovati. Nastavitve in ključ API se izbrišejo s tega Maca."}}}},"Scratch folder":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Začasna mapa"}}}},"Folder":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Mapa"}}}},"Show in Finder":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Pokaži v Finderju"}}}},"Default":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Privzeto"}}}},"Temporary files of agents: conversations, outputs, attachments. Choosing another folder moves them into a “Mini Gateway Scratch” folder inside it, for example on a fast external SSD. If that disk is not connected, the default folder is used.":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Začasne datoteke agentov: pogovori, izhodi, priponke. Ob izbiri druge mape se premaknejo v mapo »Mini Gateway Scratch« v njej, npr. na hitrem zunanjem SSD. Če ta disk ni priklopljen, se uporabi privzeta mapa."}}}},"The scratch folder could not be moved":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Začasne mape ni bilo mogoče premakniti"}}}},"Allowed commands":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Dovoljeni ukazi"}}}},"Network":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Omrežje"}}}},"minigw run is outside the agent sandbox: it runs the project's build with your full rights. Macs switched on here may run these commands in a folder they use from this Mac's SMB share (native mode). A sandbox reduces what the build can do (it writes only to that folder and the build caches, and your keys and app data are hidden), but it is not a security boundary: allow only Macs you would trust with your user account. Network: the build may download (Maven).":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"minigw run je zunaj peskovnika agentov: gradnjo projekta zažene z vsemi tvojimi pravicami. Maci, ki jih vklopiš tukaj, smejo te ukaze zagnati v mapi, ki jo uporabljajo s skupne rabe SMB tega Maca (način native). Peskovnik zmanjša, kaj gradnja zmore (piše le v to mapo in predpomnilnike gradnje, tvoji ključi in podatki aplikacij so skriti), a ni varnostna meja: dovoli le Macom, ki bi jim zaupal svoj uporabniški račun. Omrežje: gradnja sme prenašati (Maven)."}}}},"Network for builds":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Omrežje za gradnje"}}}},"Worktree mode":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Način worktree"}}}},"Agents in worktree mode (minigw --minigw-work=worktree) work in a git clone on this Mac: Claude CLI with Bash in Claude Code's sandbox, Codex in its own sandbox (Grok is not supported yet). They write only to the clone, their own Maven repository and temporary folders. These switches let their builds download (Maven, SwiftPM); Codex can read all your files, so its network is off by default.":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Agenti v načinu worktree (minigw --minigw-work=worktree) delajo v klonu git na tem Macu: Claude CLI z Bash v peskovniku Claude Code, Codex v svojem peskovniku (Grok še ni podprt). Pišejo le v klon, svoj repozitorij Maven in začasne mape. Ta stikala njihovim gradnjam dovolijo prenose (Maven, SwiftPM); Codex lahko bere vse tvoje datoteke, zato je njegovo omrežje privzeto izklopljeno."}}}},"Network for Codex builds":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Omrežje za gradnje Codex"}}}},"Codex can read all files of this Mac's user, so network for its builds is off by default.":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Codex lahko bere vse datoteke uporabnika tega Maca, zato je omrežje za njegove gradnje privzeto izklopljeno."}}}},"Microsoft Foundry Local: models on this Mac, without the cloud.":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Microsoft Foundry Local: modeli na tem Macu, brez oblaka."}}}},"Text and images":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Besedilo in slike"}}}},"Text":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Besedilo"}}}},"Foundry Local is not installed: brew tap microsoft/foundrylocal && brew install foundrylocal; then download a model, e.g. foundry model download phi-4-mini.":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Foundry Local ni nameščen: brew tap microsoft/foundrylocal && brew install foundrylocal; nato prenesi model, npr. foundry model download phi-4-mini."}}}},"No downloaded models: foundry model download <model>":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Ni prenesenih modelov: foundry model download <model>"}}}},"The claude-foundry models run on this Mac with Foundry Local: conversation only, no tools; images only for models that take them. Claude Code's long system prompt is not sent; these instructions are.":{"localizations":{"sl":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"Modeli claude-foundry tečejo na tem Macu s Foundry Local: le pogovor, brez orodij; slike le za modele, ki jih sprejmejo. Dolga sistemska navodila Claude Code se ne pošljejo, ta navodila pa."}}}}}}